<div id="A3.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Through this action, LLMs can <span id="A3.SS4.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">access the image content encoded in base64 format</span> by specifying the paper ID, page number, and the bounding box of the relevant region.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10: </span>Performance of Agentic Hybrid with “View” action on AirQA dataset.</figcaption>
